    "updated_at": "2022-02-22T15:25:48Z",
    "body": "The proposed API doesn't break the compatible and allows to add other options. But I only ask for the `{ crendentials: \"omit\" }` option because I don't know enough about the _HTTP_ and _WebSocket_ standard to know which `fetch()` option can be added in `WebSocket`.\r\n\r\nFor the workaround, I don't have a handle on the server. My WebExtension connects to the Kodi media center which is often installed on a server in the local network. Kodi already provides several services and users can also install other programs on the server. 😕",
